      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Vertex AI**\n\nI've decided to use Google Cloud's Vertex AI as the LLM provider for the Python script. I will now integrate the necessary provider-specific authentication and API calls to interact with the chosen Vertex AI model. I'll focus on how to structure the prompts to the LLM. I'm aiming for clarity in calling the hosted LLM.\n\n\n**Selecting Gemini-Pro**\n\nI'm now integrating Vertex AI, focusing on the `answer_with_context.py` script. The plan is set: I'll use `gemini-pro` as the generative model and leverage the `google.cloud.aiplatform` library. I'm building a function that takes a question and context, calls the LLM, and outputs an answer. The next step is writing the code directly using the write tool.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789820380792,
          "start": 1789820376664
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b99b9658001VAoe8eoEjOlEbT",
